# Title: Potentially Suspicious Call To Win32_NTEventlogFile Class - PSScript
# ID: e2812b49-bae0-4b21-b366-7c142eafcde2
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-07-13
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment
# Description: Detects usage of the WMI class "Win32_NTEventlogFile" in a potentially suspicious way (delete, backup, change permissions, etc.) from a PowerShell script
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((@ScriptBlockText:*Win32_NTEventlogFile*) AND ((@ScriptBlockText:*.BackupEventlog(* OR @ScriptBlockText:*.ChangeSecurityPermissions(* OR @ScriptBlockText:*.ChangeSecurityPermissionsEx(* OR @ScriptBlockText:*.ClearEventLog(* OR @ScriptBlockText:*.Delete(* OR @ScriptBlockText:*.DeleteEx(* OR @ScriptBlockText:*.Rename(* OR @ScriptBlockText:*.TakeOwnerShip(* OR @ScriptBlockText:*.TakeOwnerShipEx(*)))
